      "notes": "A native sequence prints its elements in their DEBUG form, and an object's Debug is the same `render` its Display is (value/mod.rs:463, 717). The fork reached Go's `%v` here and printed `[&{rouge}]`."
    },
    {
      "id": "opaque/render-nested-list",
      "surface": "rendering",
      "form": "expression",
      "source": "[[member]]",
      "inputs": [
        { "name": "member", "value": { "kind": "opaque_map", "canonical": "RED", "display": "rouge" } }
