      "inputs": [
        { "name": "member", "value": { "kind": "opaque_map", "canonical": "RED", "display": "rouge" } }
      ],
      "expect": "error",
      "notes": "Finding #1. `str.join` takes `values.try_iter()?` (pycompat.rs:260-271); a non-enumerable map has no iterator, so this FAULTS `map is not iterable` rather than joining nil as an empty list. The out-do the fix removes rendered \"\" here."
    },
