        { "name": "m", "value": { "kind": "map", "entries": [] } }
      ],
      "expect": "bytes",
      "notes": "The other side of the fix: a KNOWN-EMPTY enumerable map still joins to \"\", because its pair iterator exists and is empty. Only the non-enumerable map faults."
